  << /ActualText (Background\072 WealthEngine scores every profile on two things\072 how much money someone has\054 and how likely they are to give it away\056 Those two numbers are the first thing a fundraiser looks at and the filter that decides who gets contacted at all\056)
     /K [ 4 ]
