7895 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Problem\072 Two scores side by side\054 one legend between them\056 Higher was better on one\054 lower on the other\056\nNeither had a reference point\056 The same person can be a major prospect for a small charity and below the threshold for a national one\054 and the score couldn\047t tell you which you were looking at\056\nThe people who used the platform most had stopped looking at it entirely\056\nThe brief was to make the score clearer\056 Research showed nobody stops at the score\054 so I proposed the redesign should serve what happens after it\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 7896 0 R
     /Pg 7571 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
